@startuml tiers
!include style.iuml
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 14
}

rectangle "**Rules**\nwhat the agent must always do\n\n//AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md//\nalways in context · reviewed like code\n\n//e.g. tabs, phase gates, test style//" as R #FEF3C7
rectangle "**State**\nwhere we are right now\n\n//memory/ markdown, tracked in git//\nactiveContext · progress · archive\nrewritten as work moves on\n//+ decisions.md (append-only log)//\n\n//e.g. next step, open bugs, branch focus//" as S #DCFCE7
rectangle "**Facts**\ndated, one fact per note, still true later\n\n//jevmem (typed SQLite graph)//\nrecalled on demand · consolidated\n\n//e.g. why Move is verified,//\n//bug causes, gotchas, preferences//" as F #E0F2FE

S -right-> F : a significant decision\nis also written as a\none-fact note
note bottom of S
  If stored in jevmem as a "fact",
  it goes stale silently.
end note
F -[hidden]right-> R
note bottom of R
  Duplicated in recall = tokens
  spent twice (jevmem skips
  notes AGENTS.md already says).
end note
@enduml
